@startuml
title Reviews Wall - API sequence

actor User
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "Reviews API" as API

User -> FE : open drawer
FE -> API : GET /api/reviews/summary?room=chambre
API --> FE : summary
FE -> API : GET /api/reviews/list?room=chambre&limit=10
API --> FE : reviews + cursor

User -> FE : click load more
FE -> API : GET /api/reviews/list?cursor=...&limit=10
API --> FE : next reviews

User -> FE : submit review
FE -> API : POST /api/reviews/submit
API --> FE : 202 Accepted (pending)

@enduml
